  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development and Implementation to support the India-EU Water Partnership - phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Action to strengthen knowledge and experience exchange between public and private sector stakeholders in EUMS and India with regard to the water sector (including River Basin Management), thereby facilitating a progressive convergence by India towards relevant EU policies and standards on water management. This will be achieved by sharing best practices and learnings, by promoting policy dialogue, joint research and business cooperation between India, the EU and the EUMS in the water sector.</narrative>
  </description>
